# Data pipeline: raw/pending/judgment hold full-fidelity JIRA/GitHub data and
# untrusted judge output — never publication-safe, never committed. Only
# data/snapshots/<epic>/ (produced by scripts/merge.ts) is committed. These
# ignore whole trees, so the per-epic sub-directories under them are covered.
data/raw/
data/pending/
data/judgment/
*.tmp
